  "sourceTitle": "Soft Molasses Ginger Cookies",
  "sourceText": "Soft Molasses Ginger Cookies\nBy: Cresent\nPublished: Wednesday, February 24, 2010 - 12:57am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 cup shortening\n1 cup sugar\n1 cup light molasses\n1 tablespoon vinegar\n2 eggs, beaten\n6 cups flour\n1 teaspoon baking soda\n1 teaspoon cinnamon\n1 teaspoon ginger\n1/2 teaspoon salt\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Bring shortening, sugar, molasses, and vinegar to a boil. Cool. Add eggs and dry ingredients. Chill. Roll out to 1/4 inch, cut and place on greased cookie sheet. bake at 350 degrees for 12-15 minutes. Do not over bake.",
