        "text": "1 Bring shortening, sugar, molasses, and vinegar to a boil. Cool. Add eggs and dry ingredients. Chill. Roll out to 1/4 inch, cut and place on greased cookie sheet. bake at 350 degrees for 12-15 minutes. Do not over bake."
